<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>IRS Form Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .header { font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .instruction { font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 15px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="text-align: left;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">TREASURY/IRS AND OMB USE ONLY DRAFT</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-size: 12pt;">OMB No. <span data-field="omb_number">{{ omb_number }}</span></div>
      <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Date: <span data-field="date_draft">{{ date_draft }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">SCHEDULE H</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">(For Social Security, Medicare, Withhold Income, and Federal Unemployment (FUTA) Taxes)</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 10px;">Attach to Form <span data-field="form_number_h">{{ form_number_h }}</span>, 1040, SR-1040, SR-1040-SS, 1040-NR, or 1041.</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Go to <a href="#" style="color: blue;">www.irs.gov/ScheduleH</a> for instructions and the latest information.</div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Name of employer</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Social security number</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Employer identification number (EIN)</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    Calendar year taxpayers having no household employeees in <span data-field="year_tax_filing">{{ year_tax_filing }}</span> don't have to complete this form for <span data-field="year_tax_filing">{{ year_tax_filing }}</span>.
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="a_check">
    <label for="a_check">A. Did you pay any <span data-field="household_employee_wage_threshold">{{ household_employee_wage_threshold }}</span> household employee wages cash of $3,000 or more in <span data-field="year_tax_filing">{{ year_tax_filing }}</span>? (If any household employee was your spouse, your child under age 21, your parent, or anyone under age 18, see the line A instructions before you answer this question.)</label>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="b_check">
    <label for="b_check">Yes. Skip lines B and C and go to line 1.</label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="c_check">
    <label for="c_check">No. Go to line B.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    B. Did you withhold federal income tax during <span data-field="year_tax_filing">{{ year_tax_filing }}</span> for any household employee?
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="b1_check">
    <label for="b1_check">Yes. Skip line C and go to line 7.</label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="b2_check">
    <label for="b2_check">No. Go to line C.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    C. Did you pay total cash wages of $1,000 or more in any calendar quarter of <span data-field="year_tax_filing">{{ year_tax_filing }}</span> or 2026 to all household employeees? (Don't count cash wages paid in 2025 or 2026 to your spouse, your child under age 21, or your parent.)
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="c1_check">
    <label for="c1_check">No. Stop. Don't file this schedule.</label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="c2_check">
    <label for="c2_check">Yes. Skip lines 1-9 and go to line 10.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    Part I Social Security, Medicare, and Federal Income Taxes
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 60%;">Description</td>
        <td style="width: 15%; text-align: right;">Amount</td>
        <td style="width: 15%; text-align: right;"></td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>Total cash wages subject to social security tax</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_1_amount">{{ line_1_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_1_box_2">{{ line_1_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>Social security tax. Multiply line 1 by 12.4% (0.124)</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_2_amount">{{ line_2_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_2_box_2">{{ line_2_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3</td>
        <td>Total cash wages subject to Medicare tax</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_3_amount">{{ line_3_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_3_box_2">{{ line_3_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>4</td>
        <td>Medicare tax. Multiply line 3 by 2.9% (0.029)</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_4_amount">{{ line_4_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_4_box_2">{{ line_4_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>5</td>
        <td>Total cash wages subject to Additional Medicare Tax withholding</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_5_amount">{{ line_5_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_5_box_2">{{ line_5_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>6</td>
        <td>Additional Medicare Tax withholding. Multiply line 5 by 0.9% (0.009)</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_6_amount">{{ line_6_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_6_box_2">{{ line_6_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>7</td>
        <td>Federal income tax withheld, if any</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_7_amount">{{ line_7_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_7_box_2">{{ line_7_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>8</td>
        <td>Total social security, Medicare, and federal income taxes. Add lines 2, 4, 6, and 7</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_8_amount">{{ line_8_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_8_box_2">{{ line_8_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    9. Did you pay total cash wages of $1,000 or more in any calendar quarter of <span data-field="year_tax_filing">{{ year_tax_filing }}</span> or 2026 to all household employeees? (Don't count cash wages paid in 2025 or 2026 to your spouse, your child under age 21, or your parent.)
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="q_check">
    <label for="q_check">No. Stop. Include the amount from line 8 above on Schedule 2 (Form 1040), line 17a. If you're not required to file Form 1040, see the line 9 instructions.</label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="r_check">
    <label for="r_check">Yes. Go to line 10.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    Part IV Address and Signature — Complete this part only if required. See the line 27 instructions.
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Address (number and street) or P.O. box if mail isn't delivered to street address</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Apt., room, or suite no.</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">City, town, or post office</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">State</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">ZIP code</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="instruction" style="font-size: 0.85em;">
    Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I have examined this schedule, including accompanying statements, and to the best of my knowledge and belief, it is true, correct, and complete. No part of any payment made to a state unemployment fund claimed as a credit was, or is to be, deducted from the payments to employeees. Declaration of preparer (other than taxpayer) is based on all information of which preparer has knowledge.
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Employer's signature</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Preparer's name</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Date</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Preparer's signature</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Date</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Check if self-employed</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Paid Preparer Use Only</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Firm's name</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Phone no.</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Firm's address</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">TREASURY/IRS AND OMB USE ONLY DRAFT</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Part II Federal Unemployment (FUTA) Tax</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Page 2</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    10. Did you pay unemployment contributions to only one state? If you paid contributions to a credit reduction state, see instructions and check "No".
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="futa_one_state_check">
    <label for="futa_one_state_check">Yes</label>
    <input type="checkbox" id="futa_not_one_state_check">
    <label for="futa_not_one_state_check">No</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    11. Did you pay all state unemployment contributions for <span data-field="year_tax_filing">{{ year_tax_filing }}</span> to <span data-field="state_name">{{ state_name }}</span>? Fiscal year fillers, see instructions.
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="futa_state_paid_check">
    <label for="futa_state_paid_check">Yes</label>
    <input type="checkbox" id="futa_state_not_paid_check">
    <label for="futa_state_not_paid_check">No</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    12. Were all wages that are taxable for FUTA tax also taxable for your state's unemployment tax?
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="futa_all_wages_taxable_check">
    <label for="futa_all_wages_taxable_check">Yes</label>
    <input type="checkbox" id="futa_not_all_wages_taxable_check">
    <label for="futa_not_all_wages_taxable_check">No</label>
  </div>

  <div class="instruction" style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 20px;">
    Next: If you checked the "No" box on all the lines above, complete Section A and complete Section B.
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    Section A
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Name of the state where you paid unemployment contributions</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>13</td>
        <td><span data-field="state_name_a">{{ state_name_a }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="state_code_a">{{ state_code_a }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="state_tax_rate_a">{{ state_tax_rate_a }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    14. Contributions paid to your state unemployment fund
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Total cash wages subject to FUTA tax</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>15</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_15_amount">{{ line_15_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_15_box_1">{{ line_15_box_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_15_box_2">{{ line_15_box_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    16. FUTA tax. Multiply line 15 by 0.6% (0.006). Enter the result here, skip Section B, and go to line 25.
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">FUTA tax</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Amount</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    Section B
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Name of state</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">State experience rate</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Multiply col. (b) by 0.054</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Multiply col. (b) by col. (c)</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Contributions paid to state unemployment fund</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>(a)</td>
        <td><span data-field="state_name_b">{{ state_name_b }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="state_rate_b">{{ state_rate_b }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="calc_b_054">{{ calc_b_054 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="calc_b_c">{{ calc_b_c }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="contrib_b">{{ contrib_b }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    18. Totals
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
        <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>19</td>
        <td>Add columns (g) and (h) of line 18</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_19_amount">{{ line_19_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_19_box_2">{{ line_19_box_2 }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>20</td>
        <td>Total cash wages subject to FUTA tax (see the line 15 instructions)</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_20_amount">{{ line_20_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_20_box_2">{{ line_20_box_2 }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>21</td>
        <td>Multiply line 20 by 6.0% (0.06)</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_21_amount">{{ line_21_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_21_box_2">{{ line_21_box_2 }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>22</td>
        <td>Multiply line 20 by 5.4% (0.054)</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_22_amount">{{ line_22_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_22_box_2">{{ line_22_box_2 }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>23</td>
        <td>Enter the smaller of line 19 or line 22</td>
        <td><span data-field="line_23_amount">{{ line_23_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_23_box_2">{{ line_23_box_2 }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="instruction" style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 20px;">
    If you paid state unemployment contributions late or you're in a credit reduction state, see instructions and check here.
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    Part IVA. FUTA tax. Subtract line 23 from line 21. Enter the result here and go to line 25.
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">FUTA tax</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Amount</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    25. Enter the amount from line 8 if you checked the "Yes" box on line C of page 1, enter -0- if you checked the "No" box on line C of page 1.
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">FUTA tax</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">Amount</div>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    26. Are you required to file Form 1040?
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <input type="checkbox" id="req_1040_yes">
    <label for="req_1040_yes">Yes</label>
    <input type="checkbox" id="req_1040_no">
    <label for="req_1040_no">No</label>
  </div>

  <div class="instruction" style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 20px;">
    If you checked "No" on line 26, complete Part IV. See instructions for details.
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    Part IV Address and Signature — Complete this part only if required. See the line 27 instructions.
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Address (number and street) or P.O. box if mail isn't delivered to street address</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Apt., room, or suite no.</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">City, town, or post office</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">State</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">ZIP code</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 15px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="instruction" style="font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 50px;">
    Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I have examined this schedule, including accompanying statements, and to the best of my knowledge and belief, it is true, correct, and complete. No part of any payment made to a state unemployment fund claimed as a credit was, or is to be, deducted from the payments to employeees. Declaration of preparer (other than taxpayer) is based on all information of which preparer has knowledge.
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Employer's signature</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Preparer's name</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Date</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Preparer's signature</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Date</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Check if self-employed</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Paid Preparer Use Only</div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 20px;"></div>
      <div style="font-weight: bold;">Firm's name</div>
